TI  - ENGINEERING STUDENTS’ SELF-REGULATION COMPETENCIES – THE RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN PERCEPTIONS AND SUMMATIVE SCORES
PY  - 2023
T2  - Proceedings of the International CDIO Conference
SP  - 923
