TI  - AUTOMATED ASSESSMENT AND PEER EVALUATION OF UNIVERSITY STUDENTS USING ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE TOOLS
PY  - 2026
T2  - 19th IADIS International Conference Information Systems 2026 and 24th International Conference on e-Society, IS ES 2026
SP  - 369
